{"suttaId":"tha-ap429","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[275,333],"vripara":"88"},"segments":{"tha-ap429:0.3":"Ekadhammassavaniyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap429:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","tha-ap429:1.3":"Catusaccaṃ pakāsento, santāresi bahuṃ janaṃ.","tha-ap429:2.1":"“Ahaṃ tena samayena, jaṭilo uggatāpano;","tha-ap429:2.3":"Dhunanto vākacīrāni, gacchāmi ambare tadā.","tha-ap429:3.1":"“Buddhaseṭṭhassa upari, gantuṃ na visahāmahaṃ;","tha-ap429:3.3":"Pakkhīva selamāsajja, gamanaṃ na labhāmahaṃ.","tha-ap429:4.1":"“Udake vokkamitvāna, evaṃ gacchāmi ambare;","tha-ap429:4.3":"Na me idaṃ bhūtapubbaṃ, iriyāpathavikopanaṃ.","tha-ap429:5.1":"“Handa metaṃ gavesissaṃ, appevatthaṃ labheyyahaṃ;","tha-ap429:5.3":"Orohanto antalikkhā, saddamassosi satthuno.","tha-ap429:6.1":"“Sarena rajanīyena, savanīyena vaggunā;","tha-ap429:6.3":"Aniccataṃ kathentassa, taññeva uggahiṃ tadā;","tha-ap429:6.5":"Aniccasaññamuggayha, agamāsiṃ mamassamaṃ.","tha-ap429:7.1":"“Yāvatāyuṃ vasitvāna, tattha kālaṅkato ahaṃ;","tha-ap429:7.3":"Carime vattamānamhi, saddhammassavanaṃ sariṃ.","tha-ap429:8.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap429:8.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap429:9.1":"“Tiṃsakappasahassāni, devaloke ramiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap429:9.3":"Ekapaññāsakkhattuñca, devarajjamakārayiṃ.","tha-ap429:10.1":"“Ekavīsatikkhattuñca [ekatiṃsati …(syā.)], cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap429:10.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap429:11.1":"“Anubhomi sakaṃ puññaṃ, sukhitohaṃ bhavābhave;","tha-ap429:11.3":"Anussarāmi taṃ saññaṃ, saṃsaranto bhavābhave;","tha-ap429:11.5":"Na koṭiṃ paṭivijjhāmi, nibbānaṃ accutaṃ padaṃ.","tha-ap429:12.1":"“Pitugehe nisīditvā, samaṇo bhāvitindriyo;","tha-ap429:12.3":"Kathaṃsa [kathayaṃ (sī. pī. ka.)] paridīpento, aniccatamudāhari.","tha-ap429:13.1":"“‘Aniccā vata saṅkhārā, uppādavayadhammino;","tha-ap429:13.3":"Uppajjitvā nirujjhanti, tesaṃ vūpasamo sukho’.","tha-ap429:14.1":"“Saha gāthaṃ suṇitvāna, pubbasaññamanussariṃ;","tha-ap429:14.3":"Ekāsane nisīditvā, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","tha-ap429:15.1":"“Jātiyā sattavassena, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ;","tha-ap429:15.3":"Upasampādayī buddho, dhammassavanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap429:16.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ dhammamasuṇiṃ tadā;","tha-ap429:16.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, dhammassavanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap429:17.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap429:18.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap429:19.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap429:20.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ekadhammassavaniyo thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap429:21.1":"Ekadhammassavaniyattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
